---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

---

<PageLayout
  title="Khao Sok Park Tour – The Spirit of Khao Sok with Half-day hike"
  description="Indulge in nature with our Khao Sok park tour. Immerse yourself in the jungle, enjoy canoeing or river tubing. Explore the national park."
  heroImage="/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/spirit-of-khao-sok-package-2.jpg"
  heroTitle="Khao Sok Park Tour – The Spirit of Khao Sok with Half-day hike"
  heroSubtitle="Curated Rainforest Adventures & Park Excursions"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Khao Sok Package Tour Spirit", "href": "/khao-sok-package-tour-spirit/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Spirit of Khao Sok 2 Days 1 Night</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          *Note: This package does not include an overnight stay on the lake.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Day 1: </strong>Arrive at Riverside Cottages and start your Khao Sok Park tour. Check in to your room and soak up the jungle atmosphere. In the afternoon, take a <a href="/khao-sok-canoe-trip-sabai-sabai/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">guided canoe trip</a> or go <a href="/khao-sok-river-tubing/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">river tubing </a>on the Khao Sok river. You can relax and look for birds and monkeys in the warm sun.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          For a more relaxed option, choose a one hour Thai massage instead. Spend the late afternoon swimming in the river, relaxing on the sandy bank, or enjoying the view from your wooden deck.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Day 2: </strong>Your Khao Sok park tour continues on day 2. After a sound sleep, wake up to the sounds of forest birds chirping and gibbons singing on the mountaintops. After a delicious breakfast, get to know the jungle with a half day hike in the National Park.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          If you prefer not to go trekking, head to the hot springs for a relaxing bath in the naturally heated water. You can stop at a beautiful viewpoint along the way. Return to the resort to check out of your room by 12pm. Finally, relax at the resort until you head to your next destination.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Price does not include entrance fee to Khao Sok National Park (only if you choose hiking).</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>This Khao Sok package includes breakfast, but it does not include any other meals.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
